OL,3,CNo 10 says 'not possible' to block
OL,4,C'one or two' killers from early release
OL,6,FThe government has said it is "not
OL,7,Fpossible" to exempt "one or two
OL,8,Foffenders" convicted of manslaughter
OL,9,Ffrom early release, amid pressure over
OL,10,Fthe eligibility of PC Andrew Harper's
OL,11,Fkillers to be freed from prison from
OL,12,FJanuary.
OL,14,FNo 10 insisted Prime Minister Andy
OL,15,FBurnham is "far from accepting the
OL,16,Fsituation" but appeared to play down
OL,17,Fthe prospect of an imminent carve-out
OL,18,Fto keep Jessie Cole and Albert Bowers
OL,19,Fbehind bars.
OL,26,@oD@UOUpD@JO]
