PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786472311
OL,3,CNo 10 says 'not possible' to block
OL,4,C'one or two' killers from early release
OL,6,FDowning Street has so far resisted
OL,7,Fpressure to exempt the two killers
OL,8,Ffrom its early release scheme, which
OL,9,Fwill start in October in a bid to
OL,10,Ftackle prison overcrowding.
OL,12,FSome 5,000 people are expected to be
OL,13,Freleased early under sentencing
OL,14,Fchanges, down from 6,000 after the
OL,15,Fexemptions announced as part of an
OL,16,Furgent review of the scheme.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
