CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786472311
OL,3,CNo 10 says 'not possible' to block
OL,4,C'one or two' killers from early release
OL,6,FPC Andrew Harper, 28, was fatally
OL,7,Finjured in 2019, when he got caught in
OL,8,Fa strap attached to the back of a car
OL,9,Fwhile responding to a quad bike theft
OL,10,Fin Sulhamstead, Berkshire.
OL,12,FHe was dragged down a country road as
OL,13,Fthe three teenage suspects, including
OL,14,Fpassengers Jessie Cole and Albert
OL,15,FBowers, fled the scene of the burglary.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
