CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786472311
OL,3,CNo 10 says 'not possible' to block
OL,4,C'one or two' killers from early release
OL,6,FUnder current plans, Cole and Bowers
OL,7,Fremain eligible to be freed halfway
OL,8,Fthrough their 13-year sentences after
OL,9,Fthey were convicted of manslaughter in
OL,10,F2020 following Pc Harper's death in
OL,11,F2019.
OL,13,FMore than 880,000 people have signed a
OL,14,Fpetition calling for them to remain in
OL,15,Fjail, with a Government source telling
OL,16,FThe Daily Telegraph on Friday the
OL,17,FPrime Minister is prepared to "explore
OL,18,Fevery option" to block their early
OL,19,Frelease.
OL,26,@yD@_OUzD@MO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/7
