OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786472311
OL,3,CNo 10 says 'not possible' to block
OL,4,C'one or two' killers from early release
OL,6,FAsked whether this was correct on
OL,7,FMonday, Mr Burnham's official
OL,8,Fspokesman said manslaughter of an
OL,9,Femergency worker was "not a standalone
OL,10,Foffence" and it was "not possible to
OL,11,Fsimply exclude one or two offenders"
OL,12,Fwithin the wider category of
OL,13,Fmanslaughter.
OL,15,FAsked whether ministers were accepting
OL,16,Fthe situation as it stands, the
OL,17,Fspokesman said: "I think you've seen
OL,18,Ffrom the Prime Minister's words that
OL,19,Fhe's far from accepting the situation
OL,20,Fand as he wrote last week he wants to
OL,21,Fgo even further.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786472311
OL,3,CNo 10 says 'not possible' to block
OL,4,C'one or two' killers from early release
OL,6,F"He's pushed hard on what more we
OL,7,Fcould do and his focus now is on
OL,8,Ffixing the prison system long term to
OL,9,Favoid a repeat of this prison crisis
OL,10,Fso that it never happens again."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,390,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F389A1786472311
OL,3,CNo 10 says 'not possible' to block
OL,4,C'one or two' killers from early release
OL,6,FPressed on whether the Prime Minister
OL,7,Fwas admitting there was nothing more
OL,8,Fhe could do, the official said: "He
OL,9,Funderstands the public wants him to go
OL,10,Ffurther, and he wanted to go further,
OL,11,Fbut on the wider issue that prisons
OL,12,Fwould have run out of space, police
OL,13,Fwould stop making arrests, it would be
OL,14,Fimpossible to lock up convicted
OL,15,Foffenders and that would put public
OL,16,Fsafety at untold risk."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
